@Adalyat the root challenge if you care to take a crack at it --> resolving the account currency from the pair string e.g. "EURUSD". It uses the 3/6 length to determine the individual currencies in the pair. Something like: ETHUSDT is difficult to resolve: is it `ETHU-SDT`? or `ET-HUSDT` etc.

It might be simplest to simply start accepting "/" as a divider.

Or what we currently do -> scan the known currencies and try and find a match.
